# Body frame x forward (= -x CAD, LE side), y right (= +y CAD, servo R), z down (= -z CAD), relative to the CAD CG (sitl/cad_mass.json, 2026-11-23: x 22.05 mm aft of the LE, y -3.32 mm, z 6.56 mm; board centre x 47.0, y -75.0, z 17.68 mm, redesign/qp/A/cad/amodel/electrical.py FC_*).
